      "start_seconds": 0.52,
      "end_seconds": 2.49,
      "duration_seconds": 1.97,
      "text": "welcome make yourself comfortable"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 3.2,
      "end_seconds": 4.4,
      "duration_seconds": 1.2,
      "text": "hi there"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 5.43,
      "end_seconds": 11.24,
      "duration_seconds": 5.81,
      "text": "mm, um, thank you for fitting us in, doctor"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 13.24,
      "end_seconds": 18.25,
      "duration_seconds": 5.01,
      "text": "good, that'll be useful pull up a chair what's been worrying you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 20.67,
      "end_seconds": 30.06,
      "duration_seconds": 9.39,
      "text": "mainly a chronic cough with lots of phlegm there's a couple of other things, but that's the main one"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 30.68,
      "end_seconds": 32.98,
      "duration_seconds": 2.3,
      "text": "Did it come on recently?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 34.88,
      "end_seconds": 49.36,
      "duration_seconds": 14.48,
      "text": "Ten days, I think... sorry, about four days, I got that wrong. I've been putting this off for weeks. I didn't wanna bother you but it keeps coming back."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 50.92,
      "end_seconds": 53.85,
      "duration_seconds": 2.93,
      "text": "how strong would you say it is?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 55.34,
      "end_seconds": 57.54,
      "duration_seconds": 2.2,
      "text": "it's, It's mild, honestly"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 57.96,
      "end_seconds": 60.73,
      "duration_seconds": 2.77,
      "text": "sure is it worse at certain times?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 61.77,
      "end_seconds": 74.1,
      "duration_seconds": 12.33,
      "text": "it's worse with mornings. I've I've also had tiredness for about a month. Ah and there's green phlegm lately as well six months now"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 76.1,
      "end_seconds": 83.79,
      "duration_seconds": 7.69,
      "text": "have you had a chronic cough with lots of phlegm before, or is this the first time?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 85.7,
      "end_seconds": 93.53,
      "duration_seconds": 7.83,
      "text": "I had a similar thing a couple of years ago. It went away"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 96.81,
      "end_seconds": 108.27,
      "duration_seconds": 11.46,
      "text": "okay, so the vitals from earlier saturation 99 percent, respiratory rate 14, BP is 125 over 73, pulse 70, height 152 centimetres, weight 87 kilos, temp 36.4 degrees"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 108.82,
      "end_seconds": 110.2,
      "duration_seconds": 1.38,
      "text": "good, thank you"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 111.49,
      "end_seconds": 114.93,
      "duration_seconds": 3.44,
      "text": "Right let's have a proper look at you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 116.64,
      "end_seconds": 118.69,
      "duration_seconds": 2.05,
      "text": "Tell me if that's sore."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 135.09,
      "end_seconds": 140.71,
      "duration_seconds": 5.62,
      "text": "There are coarse crackles at both bases and the fingers are slightly clubbed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 142.11,
      "end_seconds": 143.19,
      "duration_seconds": 1.08,
      "text": "Sure thing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 148.38,
      "end_seconds": 150.54,
      "duration_seconds": 2.16,
      "text": "so, please sit back down"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 161.64,
      "end_seconds": 163.03,
      "duration_seconds": 1.39,
      "text": "Nothing like fever?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 164.62,
      "end_seconds": 167.83,
      "duration_seconds": 3.21,
      "text": "Not that I've noticed, no fever."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 168.94,
      "end_seconds": 174.48,
      "duration_seconds": 5.54,
      "text": "Actually doctor I did notice fever. She doesn't always say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 175.94,
      "end_seconds": 182.91,
      "duration_seconds": 6.97,
      "text": "Mm, no, I don't think I did. Maybe a little, I'm not sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 184.0,
      "end_seconds": 192.78,
      "duration_seconds": 8.78,
      "text": "Alright, I'll note both what you've said and what you've noticed. Any chest pain, weight loss or coughing up blood?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 193.6,
      "end_seconds": 202.29,
      "duration_seconds": 8.69,
      "text": "I mean, um, no chest pain, weight loss or coughing up blood, none of it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 204.31,
      "end_seconds": 206.36,
      "duration_seconds": 2.05,
      "text": "Any trouble with the waterworks?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 207.3,
      "end_seconds": 211.7,
      "duration_seconds": 4.4,
      "text": "Mm, that's normal as far as I know."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 213.18,
      "end_seconds": 217.18,
      "duration_seconds": 4.0,
      "text": "anything with your heart, like skipped beats or fainting?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 218.15,
      "end_seconds": 224.28,
      "duration_seconds": 6.13,
      "text": "My heart's been fine you know as far as I know."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 225.74,
      "end_seconds": 228.22,
      "duration_seconds": 2.48,
      "text": "have you been to theatre before?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 229.69,
      "end_seconds": 236.21,
      "duration_seconds": 6.52,
      "text": "So, just a a wisdom tooth extraction under sedation, five years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 241.64,
      "end_seconds": 244.91,
      "duration_seconds": 3.27,
      "text": "what do you take on a normal day?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 249.91,
      "end_seconds": 254.06,
      "duration_seconds": 4.15,
      "text": "So uh it's hydrocortisone cream when needed doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 255.54,
      "end_seconds": 262.93,
      "duration_seconds": 7.39,
      "text": "Let me think, I'd been on Seretide inhaler, not any more though, I stopped."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 265.18,
      "end_seconds": 268.45,
      "duration_seconds": 3.27,
      "text": "any health conditions I should have on record?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 269.5,
      "end_seconds": 276.56,
      "duration_seconds": 7.06,
      "text": "I've had asthma, yes. Right, I have eczema, for two years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 277.7,
      "end_seconds": 278.5,
      "duration_seconds": 0.8,
      "text": "any smoking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 279.78,
      "end_seconds": 283.3,
      "duration_seconds": 3.52,
      "text": "I quit smoking around ten years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 284.11,
      "end_seconds": 286.19,
      "duration_seconds": 2.08,
      "text": "So, do you drink alcohol?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 288.2,
      "end_seconds": 291.57,
      "duration_seconds": 3.37,
      "text": "I only drink at family occasions"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 292.79,
      "end_seconds": 295.31,
      "duration_seconds": 2.52,
      "text": "anything you do to stay fit?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 297.23,
      "end_seconds": 300.81,
      "duration_seconds": 3.58,
      "text": "I do a yoga class on Thursdays."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 301.32,
      "end_seconds": 304.45,
      "duration_seconds": 3.13,
      "text": "what line of work are you in?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 305.8,
      "end_seconds": 311.1,
      "duration_seconds": 5.3,
      "text": "I'm a bus driver, so I sit for long hours."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 320.27,
      "end_seconds": 329.76,
      "duration_seconds": 9.49,
      "text": "taking everything into account, this is probably a flare of bronchiectasis a chest infection is also on my list"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 331.09,
      "end_seconds": 335.21,
      "duration_seconds": 4.12,
      "text": "is there something to to worry about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 336.84,
      "end_seconds": 345.39,
      "duration_seconds": 8.55,
      "text": "it's reasonable to be concerned, but right now a flare of bronchiectasis is my leading thought, not anything worse"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 359.8,
      "end_seconds": 364.73,
      "duration_seconds": 4.93,
      "text": "A chest X-ray is what I'd like next, for bronchiectasis flare"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 365.91,
      "end_seconds": 369.07,
      "duration_seconds": 3.16,
      "text": "where would I go for that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 370.35,
      "end_seconds": 396.82,
      "duration_seconds": 26.47,
      "text": "I'm gonna order a sputum culture, for purulent sputum. I'll start you on clarithromycin, 500 milligrams, twice a day, fourteen days. That's for bronchiectasis flare. It's a commonly used medicine and most people tolerate it it well. Keep up your airway clearance exercises twice a day. Come back or go to emergency straight away if the symptoms get worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 397.74,
      "end_seconds": 399.49,
      "duration_seconds": 1.75,
      "text": "Okay, makes sense."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 401.04,
      "end_seconds": 410.08,
      "duration_seconds": 9.04,
      "text": "I'd like to see you again in two weeks. Right, that's the plan. Do you wanna ask me anything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 411.18,
      "end_seconds": 416.52,
      "duration_seconds": 5.34,
      "text": "let me think I think I understand everything. Thanks"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 420.19,
      "end_seconds": 422.31,
      "duration_seconds": 2.12,
      "text": "have a a good day"
    }
  ]
}